First update is here! But look at this changelog, it is incredibly short! Looks like this time we didn't include a thousand bugs in the game!

Changelog

 Food resources now give the right amount of food;
 Fixed the lack of reward in the "Lonely Bunker" quest;
 Fixed the lack of XP gain in the "Lonely Bunker" quest;
 Fixed two string lacking a proper translation in italian; 
 Fixed the lack of Autosave after a couple dialogues;
 Increased the reward for the "Hostile Mutants" quest;
 Fixed UI bug preventing to exit some screens with Esc key;


What if you found a bug? Well, click here and tell us what you found, we'll immediately put our [strike]slaves[/strike] team on it!

